This is a good idea because magic traps are fun.  I once had a Valkyrie
at experience level 8 before he ever left dlevel 1.  Also, due to the magic
trap his stats indicated that this Valkyrie was much less of a dolt than
the other Valkyries I'd seen.

Perhaps it should be limited so that the wand explodes after it creates
one trap.  If one wand could create lots of magic traps there would be
lots of room for abuse.

Layne Hellickson suggests:
	a blessed wand of nothing creates a magic trap
	a cursed wand of nothing creates an anti-magic trap
	and a normal wand truly does nothing.


